  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>8</mn></munderover><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>8</mn></munderover><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Adding both equations, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>8</mn></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
  }
